# ============================================================
# GPPS -- Risk Taxonomy at DISTINCT POLICY ID level, per country
#
# One row per (country, policy_core_id). objRel-level taxonomy is
# rolled UP to the policy: a policy counts as classified at L1 if
# ANY of its objRel entries carries an L1 value.
#
# Columns produced per policy:
#   - policy-grain sources : policyRiskTypePrimary,
#                            policyApplication.riskTxnmyL2Text,
#                            multiRiskDetls[].risk
#   - rolled-up objRel     : any/all L1, L2, L3 + distinct values
#   - resolved taxonomy    : best available value per level,
#                            with the source it came from
# ============================================================

